      "id": "1023482",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Regular weekday Franklin/Foxboro service is operating as scheduled throughout both days. The last train from Foxboro to South Station is scheduled to depart at 10:49pm.\r\n\r\nPassengers can consider Providence/Stoughton Line service to Mansfield, which is just over 7 miles from the stadium. ",
