    {
      "id": "1021672",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Beginning July 13, 2026, the Woburn Anderson Regional Transportation Center will undergo a major paving and infrastructure improvement project, with work expected to be completed by November 16, 2026. \r\n\r\nTo support these critical renovations and enhance the long-term safety and functionality of the facility, select areas of the MBTA Daily Lot and the gated Overnight Lot will be temporarily closed throughout the construction period.\r\n\r\nMotorists and facility users are encouraged to plan accordingly and carefully follow all posted signage, traffic control measures, and parking restrictions to ensure a safe and efficient experience during the project.",
      "severity": 8,
      "route_id": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "1001816",
      "title": "",
      "description": null,
      "severity": 1,
      "route_id": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "1024396",
      "title": "",
      "description": "Travel Time:\r\nRiders using the shuttle buses should budget extra travel time. For example, a rider traveling to South Station from Worcester should budget approximately 20 extra minutes of travel in addition to their regular trip time. \r\n\r\nAffected Stations:\r\nWorcester\r\nGrafton\r\n\r\nShuttle Stop Locations:\r\nWorcester Union Station Bus Terminal (Bays #1-3)\r\nGrafton Station Parking Lot \r\n\r\nAccessibility Information:\r\nAll shuttle buses are equipped with a wheelchair lift, and all shuttle stops are accessible.",
      "severity": 8,
      "route_id": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "1001821",
      "title": "",
      "description": null,
      "severity": 1,
      "route_id": "unknown"
    },
    {
      "id": "1025139",
